{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t行政長官李家超在「國際金融領袖投資峰會」發表主題演講，他表示香港制定發展戰略藍圖時，會確保核心價值和競爭優勢。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n李家超之後乘飛機抵達北京，明天會出席京港洽談會開幕式和致辭，並與北京市官員會面，之後再到上海出席進博會，星期五返港。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:22:55.104047+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:53:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:39:16.962288+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T12:18:44.424987+00:00","content_hash":"622cde284a63e4d8a5a4362d3f2c51f92a5aa0f3e970e4d2fc58fbd18df13a3a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}